1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,904
Berith, the fallen angel, has possessed Ursula, a nun.

2
00:00:02,904 --> 00:00:05,121
You have to kill her, and then bring her back.

3
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:06,621
Here's how he plays.

4
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:11,611
Put the Divine Blessings sheet beside the board, Heavenly side up for a normal game

5
00:00:11,611 --> 00:00:13,172
or Hellish side for a hard one.

6
00:00:13,392 --> 00:00:15,931
Add the Expel Demon Action cards to the Tableau.

7
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:20,873
The Killer meeple, its health, Attack and Movement Values are all Ursula's body,

8
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:21,951
controlled by Berith.

9
00:00:22,171 --> 00:00:24,741
When possessed Ursula is killed, Berith leaves her.

10
00:00:24,741 --> 00:00:26,203
But that's only half the job.

11
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:31,288
When you see the Divine Blessing icon, put a black Final Health token face down on

12
00:00:31,288 --> 00:00:35,439
the topmost empty space of the Blessings sheet, and resolve that space's effect.

13
00:00:35,659 --> 00:00:38,806
There are seven spaces, from Wisdom down to Fear of the Lord.

14
00:00:38,806 --> 00:00:43,037
Their individual effects are printed too small on the rule sheet to read, so check

15
00:00:43,037 --> 00:00:43,915
the sheet itself.

16
00:00:44,135 --> 00:00:48,010
Tokens on the sheet can't be removed or revealed unless a card says so.

17
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:52,541
And the supply is limited: tokens used by the Killer, by you, or removed by effects

18
00:00:52,541 --> 00:00:53,905
mean fewer for the sheet.

19
00:00:54,733 --> 00:00:59,124
Blessings mostly come from Expel Demon, which you can only play in Ursula's space.

20
00:00:59,124 --> 00:01:00,088
It costs two Time.

21
00:01:00,308 --> 00:01:02,920
Three successes: two Blessings, and lose a Time.

22
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:05,151
Two successes: one Blessing, lose a Time.

23
00:01:05,371 --> 00:01:09,412
One success: one Blessing, but choose to lose a health or raise Horror, and lose a

24
00:01:09,412 --> 00:01:09,659
Time.

25
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:13,843
With no successes you still get a Blessing, but the card shows a heavier cost in

26
00:01:13,843 --> 00:01:14,636
health and Time.

27
00:01:15,467 --> 00:01:19,531
First, kill possessed Ursula under the normal rules, including revealing her black

28
00:01:19,531 --> 00:01:22,208
Final Health token and healing her if it shows health.

29
00:01:22,428 --> 00:01:25,863
Then Berith leaves her body, and Ursula must come back from the dead.

30
00:01:25,863 --> 00:01:27,953
Reveal every token on the Blessings sheet.

31
00:01:28,173 --> 00:01:31,101
If any of them shows health, her life is restored and you win.

32
00:01:31,101 --> 00:01:33,699
If they're all blank, her soul is lost, and so are you.

33
00:01:33,919 --> 00:01:37,435
You don't need all seven before the kill, but the more Blessings, the better your

34
00:01:37,435 --> 00:01:37,652
odds.

35
00:01:38,467 --> 00:01:42,327
Rejecting God: lose two Time every time a Divine Blessing is resolved.

36
00:01:42,327 --> 00:01:43,651
It's his toughest power.

37
00:01:43,871 --> 00:01:48,019
Keeping Ursula Alive: in each Upkeep she recovers a health, or if she's already

38
00:01:48,019 --> 00:01:49,332
full, Horror goes up one.

39
00:01:49,552 --> 00:01:53,992
Lamb to the Slaughter: each Upkeep, the Victim farthest from Ursula is placed in her

40
00:01:53,992 --> 00:01:54,309
space.

41
00:01:54,529 --> 00:01:58,925
The Epic Satanic Influence: during Upkeep, take damage equal to the number of normal

42
00:01:58,925 --> 00:02:00,076
Victims in your space.

43
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:05,435
Two Minor Dark Powers: Blasphemy stops you resolving Expel Demon while it's in play,

44
00:02:05,435 --> 00:02:07,919
and Demonic Curse cuts your hand limit to six.

45
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:11,153
Finales: It Wants You! targets, moves, and attacks twice.

46
00:02:11,153 --> 00:02:14,113
Hell on Earth pushes Bloodlust to the top when revealed.

47
00:02:14,113 --> 00:02:17,973
Spiritual Attack makes you lose an extra health whenever she attacks you.

48
00:02:18,193 --> 00:02:22,434
The Epic Legions of Hell hunts twice each Killer phase, and every Victim killed

49
00:02:22,434 --> 00:02:23,185
raises Horror.

50
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,001
A few tips. Don't rush the kill: every Blessing you add before she dies improves

51
00:02:28,001 --> 00:02:28,501
your odds.

52
00:02:28,721 --> 00:02:32,657
Expel Demon keeps you close to her, so bring health and Reaction cards, and save

53
00:02:32,657 --> 00:02:35,313
Victims early before Lamb to the Slaughter takes them.

54
00:02:35,533 --> 00:02:38,572
Players win about sixty-two per cent of games against him.

55
00:02:38,572 --> 00:02:39,096
Good luck.

